<p>Hello,</p>

<% if @accepted %>
  <p>Your AWS Marketplace subscription has been applied to
  <strong><%= @company.name %></strong>. That workspace is billed through AWS from now on,
  and your usage appears on your AWS bill.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>An administrator of <strong><%= @company.name %></strong> did not accept the request to
  apply your AWS Marketplace subscription to that workspace.</p>

  <p>Your subscription is unchanged and is not attached to anything. If this was a
  misunderstanding, speak to someone at <%= @company.email_domain %> and ask again, or
  unsubscribe in AWS Marketplace if you no longer want it.</p>
<% end %>
